DivineSourceBlade: {
	DisplayName: Divine Source Blade
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Four-beat combo: a counterclockwise cut, a clockwise cut,
		then a sweeping elliptical slash and a reverse cut along the same orbit
		Every swing flings homing tech bolts along the path of the blade, the reverse cut hurls a colossal azure crescent
		Damaging enemies slowly builds charge; right click to spend a full bar and empower the blade for 7 seconds
		While empowered its damage soars and the bolts give way to massive auric lances that pierce up to 3 enemies
		"Life never ceases"
		'''
}

CursedflameBloodfist: {
	DisplayName: Cursedflame Bloodfist
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Counts as both melee and magic, and takes the full bonus from each
		Hold left click to pour out a rapid flurry of punches, and keep running while you do
		Every punch lands one hit of area damage around you with very low knockback
		Each punch also scatters a stream of flying flame fists along your cursor
		Targets are set ablaze with Cursed Inferno
		The flurry drains mana as it runs and stops once you run dry
		"Whoever this arm belonged to, the fire has burned that away"
		'''
}

Arbiter: {
	DisplayName: Arbiter
	ManifestInteractHint: "[Right Click] Wrench the axe free"
	ManifestInventoryFullHint: Inventory full - free up a slot before pulling the axe
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Hold left click to charge and raise the axe of judgment
		Release to cleave downward, sending a ground-hugging flame shockwave bursting out to both sides
		Longer charges increase the flames' reach and power
		"Judgment descends through fire"
		'''
}

Cloudwalking: {
	DisplayName: Cloudwalking
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Hold left click to charge and raise the great axe
		Release to send the axe flying forward, trailing clouds in its wake
		The axe automatically returns to you
		'''
}

DawnshatterAzure: {
	DisplayName: Dawnshatter Azure
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Hold the left button to chain a five-beat combo, the final spin igniting a corona
		Right-click to charge, then lunge toward the cursor
		"Let the flames purify your soul and utterly plunder your enemies."
		'''
}

Flawless: {
	DisplayName: Flawless
	Tooltip:
		'''
		A four-beat combo: sweep, thrust, back-sweep, finishing lunge, each landing heavier than the last
		The thrust beats swap in the slender head for extra reach, scattering frost crystal on impact
		"He changed the head seven times. The target has one hole."
		'''
}

StormGoddessSpear: {
	DisplayName: Storm Goddess Spear
	Tooltip:
		'''
		A Spear capable of sending out Fierce Lightning Kisses that bounces off enemies.
		When held, summons the lingering spirit of the Storm Goddess to assist in combat.
		[legend]
		'''
	Legend:
		'''
		Alina was once Terra’s sharpest warrior, wielding a blade of thunder to cleave through darkness, 
		her faith unwavering and absolute. But faith could not shield her from the indifference of the gods.  
		When the Supreme Deity passed judgment, her comrades, kin, oaths, and glory were reduced to ashes. 
		She witnessed firsthand how so-called justice trampled everything into dust, how order was merely a veil for the cruelest of destructions.  
		She no longer sought the light but reforged herself in the abyss. An ancient, 
		forbidden power consumed her soul, granting her strength beyond mortal comprehension.  
		Her armor became wreckage forged in the depths, her eyes burned with the remnants of thunder and darkness entwined. 
		She was no longer Terra’s guardian, but the storm itself—a vengeance that could not be stopped.  
		Her fury swept the battlefield like a howling tempest, her thunder tore through thrones and temples. 
		She fought not for justice, not for Terra, not for the gods.  
		She fought for vengeance, for annihilation—to make those who deemed themselves righteous understand the true meaning of fear.
		'''
}

DragonsScaleGreatsword: {
	DisplayName: Dragon Kelp Greatblade
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Swings follow a three-hit combo, the third unleashing a mightier draconic finisher
		Swings release spiraling kelp blade beams that burst into toxic algae clouds on hit
		True melee strikes create many toxic algae clouds
		Right-click to summon a verdant dragon soul that hunts toward the cursor, scattering toxic algae clouds along its path
		'''
}

CosmicCalamity: {
	DisplayName: Galactic Disaster
	Tooltip: Attack generates crescent-shaped shock waves.
}

SpearOfLonginus: {
	DisplayName: Spear of Longinus
	Tooltip:
		'''
		While held, a holy cross forms beneath you and steadily fills with divine energy.
		Each time the bar is filled, the Spear gains one charge, up to a maximum of six fields of holy power.
		Marks the nearest enemy with the cross of fate while held.
		Striking a marked enemy with a charged throw unleashes the Pilgrim's Fury.
		[legend]
		'''
	Legend:
		'''

		O shattered god, permit me to atone for my sins. 
		The war has sprawled across centuries, and I, a fugitive fleeing the grand civilization,
		eke out a meager existence on this desolate planet at the edge of the universe.
		Thousands of light-years away, the colossal war machines of conflict grind stars to dust.
		Savage and dreadful assaults erase light-years of stellar expanse in the blink of an eye, transforming it into a domain of silence.
		For countless centuries, this war has raged on. Now, the mighty civilization to which I belong teeters on the brink,
		and I shall become a cosmic sinner, the most disrespectful blasphemer.
		My flesh has decayed, my bones mirroring the wrinkles of passing ages. 
		I am on the verge of becoming one of the feeble machines I created. 
		Before that fate befalls me, may the gods grant me forgiveness and pardon my disrespect towards this supreme being. 
		Let me descend into the abyss of purgatory, enduring endless torment as my soul falls.
		Yet, for the sake of my civilization, for victory in this war spanning centuries, I must harness the fragmented power of this godly entity.
		To guide its mysterious force, I have no choice but to infuse its shattered divine form with the cold embrace of machinery.
		This is an inevitable sacrilege. For the continuity of civilization, for the triumph of war, 
		I must become the most devout follower of this supreme entity, the most disrespectful blasphemer in history.
		'''
}

NeutronGlaive: {
	DisplayName: Black Zone Cleaver
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Swinging releases powerful gravitational sword waves, causing a neutron star explosion upon hitting a target.
		Right-click to charge the blade; releasing it when fully charged triggers a large neutron star explosion at the cursor.
		Releasing before fully charged will cause the energy to spill out.
		'''
}

NeutronScythe: {
	DisplayName: Blackhole Messenger
	Tooltip:
		'''
		A high-speed spinning neutron scythe that fires gamma rays at nearby enemies and leaves warp detonation points along its path.
		Right click to unleash a Blackhole Burst, hurling thirteen scythes outward in a full circle.
		'''
}

RebelBlade: {
	DisplayName: Rebel Blade
	Tooltip:
		'''
		True melee generates a large number of demon light balls around the target
		Right click to control blade flight and cut towards the cursor
		'''
}

WeaverGrievances: {
	DisplayName: Weaver Grievances
	RitualInteractHint: "[Right-click] Pull the blade free"
	RitualInventoryFullHint: Your inventory is full. Make room before pulling the blade.
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Unleash a large number of claws of Evil spirits and have special effects in hell and dungeon environments
		Swings follow a three-hit combo, the third unleashing a sweeping whirlwind finisher
		Right-click and roll in the direction of the cursor as a wheel of vengeful souls. Hitting an enemy during the roll will give the player an invincible frame
		A close roll would be considered a perfect dodge
		[legend]
		'''
	Legend:
		'''
		The eternal dungeon stretches across the land, its walls etched with the inscriptions and screams of ancient warriors. 
		Each stone is saturated with lingering malice, like chains of the damned, binding it to the endless darkness at time’s end.  
		These warriors were once the blades of their king, waging war across the realms. 
		Their swords had illuminated countless battlefields, their blood forged the towering empire. 
		Their loyalty was as enduring as the stars, their conviction as unyielding as iron.  
		Yet, when the wars ceased, and the Demonlord’s banners were torn asunder at the king’s feet, 
		the moment peace descended, the king decreed their consignment to the abyss.  
		“We betrayed not, yet the king has betrayed us!” The anguished wails of the damned tore through the void, piercing the silence of eternity. 
		Their noble spirits did not return to the dust but were imprisoned in the void’s chasm, condemned as witnesses to eternal night.  
		The ceaseless lamentations transformed into a silent accusation, one that reached the furthest ends of the stars.  
		It is said the king, in fear of their unyielding loyalty and the inferno of their wrath, 
		heeded the whispers of the Demonlord’s sorcerers, choosing to consign these warriors to the shadows of history.  
		But malice, like a tide, has twisted the dungeon’s reality. Their suffering has shaken the barriers of time and space, weaving a prophecy of vengeance:  
		“The Demonlord shall return; the void shall be torn asunder, and our wrath shall consume all!”  
		When Terra once more faces the brink of annihilation, these restless dead will rise from the darkness. 
		Their blades will no longer fight for the glory of an empire but for the judgment of the betrayer.  
		Glory and loyalty are long since obliterated—only the flames of vengeance remain, destined to engulf all.
		'''
}

SandDagger: {
	DisplayName: Sand Dagger
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Hurled in a straight line and lightly pulled down by gravity
		Embeds on impact; if struck into sand, it builds up before bursting upward to unleash a ground shockwave and a volley of sand spikes
		'''
}

WastelandFang: {
	DisplayName: Wasteland Fang
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Bounces off blocks and accelerates when retracting
		Opens its mouth and spits out several sand orbs
		'''
}

SeasonalKunai: {
	DisplayName: Seasonal Kunai
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Throws four primary kunai in a fan; each pierces deeply and grows larger as it flies
		On hit or expiration, every blade splits into three secondary kunai sweeping outward
		Daybreak by day, Nightwither by night
		"Reflecting the Four Seasons"
		'''
}

WraithKunai: {
	DisplayName: Wraith Kunai
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Hurls three crimson blades in a fan; each hovers briefly before charging the nearest foe at high speed
		Charging strikes erupt with crimson sparks and screen shake, and the blades detonate into soulburning shockwaves at the end of their flight
		Sets enemies On Fire by day, Soul-burns them by night
		'''
}

CommandersChainsaw: {
	DisplayName: Commander's Chainsaw
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Generates sparks upon hitting a target
		"Add more diesel"
		'''
}

GeminisTribute: {
	DisplayName: Twins' Yonder
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Alternately hurls a Retinazer scythe and a Spazmatism scythe, slashing back and forth along a sine-wave path
		Right-click launches both scythes in a crossing arc; on impact a fused Twins eye condenses and rains dual-colored pulses across the area
		"Only one dominant personality can exist, and clearly, Magmaflame Eye has won."
		'''
}

DestroyersBlade: {
	DisplayName: Destroyer's Blade
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Fires thermal barrages
		"Contains the immense energy core of the Destroyer."
		'''
}

Observer: {
	DisplayName: Observer
	Tooltip: '''"It's still watching you"'''
}

Shatterfang: {
	DisplayName: Shatterfang
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Chain three swings into a staggering cleave that heavily grinds down the blade
		The cleave that drains the blade shatters it outright, hurling a huge broken-off tooth fragment
		Regular swings intermittently fling small gravity-bound tooth shards
		The half-bladed sword swings faster, but hits weaker and no longer fires shards
		Sustained attacks also destabilize the blade until it quietly crumbles
		Right-click to spend a moment mending the blade; it also knits back slowly while resting, chiming once whole
		"A fang broken from the gnashing maw, still aching to bite"
		'''
}

CommandersClaw: {
	DisplayName: Commander's Claw
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Hurl an ornate commander's spear that always keeps its tip pointing forward.
		Each impact erupts with metallic sparks, shockwaves, and a sharp screen shake.
		Multiple spears can fly at once, embedding into terrain on a wall hit and pinning to enemies on a strike.
		'''
}

CommandersChainsawEX: {
	DisplayName: Commander's Chainsaw EX
	Tooltip: '''"Shreds everything in your path"'''
}

DestroyersBladeEX: {
	DisplayName: Destroyers Blade EX
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Heavy swings unleash black-crimson slashes, energy beams and shadow bolts
		Sheathing the blade briefly engages the Stalk Protocol: increased movement speed
		While stalking, right click to become the Destroyer's maw and bite prey; with no target it lunges toward the cursor
		A successful bite deals massive damage and engages the Annihilation Protocol:
		all projectiles are empowered with homing, and finishers launch Destroyer heads
		"It's always easier to destroy than to build"
		'''
}

EnergySword: {
	DisplayName: Energy Sword
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Expend energy to shoot lasers and penetrate multiple enemies
		"Utilization is not high."
		'''
}

SporeboundRoller: {
	DisplayName: Sporebound Roller
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Generates a floating little mushroom after hitting an enemy
		"They love to keep rolling around"
		'''
}

SporeburstPouch: {
	DisplayName: Sporeburst Pouch
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Lobs a tumbling spore grenade that detonates on impact or when its lifetime ends
		Releases a toxic shockwave and a swarm of homing spore shrapnel; struck enemies are Poisoned
		'''
}

Heartcarver: {
	DisplayName: Heartcarver
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Each stab hurls a spinning blood dagger that hunts by the scent of wounds
		Right click to perform a short arcing lunge
		Absorbed hearts grant brief attack speed and condense into orbiting blood blades
		Blood blades lunge at the wound of your next Carving Strike
		'''
	CarveTip:
		'''
		While held, the blade beats in time with your heart
		Strikes landing in the gap between two heartbeats become Carving Strikes
		Finish the combo with a Carving Strike to carve the heart out whole
		'''
}

OniMachete: {
	DisplayName: Oni Machete
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Swings in a three-strike combo, ending in a gold-rending cleave that hangs a beat before it falls
		While held, six oni hands are summoned to fight alongside you
		'''
	SuppressTip:
		'''
		Swings and hits stoke the brimstone suppression; every strike the six oni hands make burns it away
		When the flame gutters out the hands grow restless: they fight harder, and may turn back to squeeze your throat
		'''
}

AncientStormGoddessSpear: {
	DisplayName: Ancient Storm Goddess Spear
	Tooltip:
		'''
		A Spear capable of sending out Fierce Lightning Kisses that bounces off enemies.
		"It is already a thing of the past, but it still works."
		[legend]
		'''
	Legend:
		'''
		Alina was once Terra’s sharpest warrior, wielding a blade of thunder to cleave through darkness, 
		her faith unwavering and absolute. But faith could not shield her from the indifference of the gods.  
		When the Supreme Deity passed judgment, her comrades, kin, oaths, and glory were reduced to ashes. 
		She witnessed firsthand how so-called justice trampled everything into dust, how order was merely a veil for the cruelest of destructions.  
		She no longer sought the light but reforged herself in the abyss. An ancient, 
		forbidden power consumed her soul, granting her strength beyond mortal comprehension.  
		Her armor became wreckage forged in the depths, her eyes burned with the remnants of thunder and darkness entwined. 
		She was no longer Terra’s guardian, but the storm itself—a vengeance that could not be stopped.  
		Her fury swept the battlefield like a howling tempest, her thunder tore through thrones and temples. 
		She fought not for justice, not for Terra, not for the gods.  
		She fought for vengeance, for annihilation—to make those who deemed themselves righteous understand the true meaning of fear.
		'''
}

Abyssrend: {
	DisplayName: Abyssrend
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Left-click alternates tip thrusts and side cuts; each strike tears off a homing ocean undercurrent
		Right-click stirs an abyssal undertow that drags foes ahead of you onto the pincer, then slams them into the nearby ground, detonating a cavitation burst
		Foes caught by the slam or the burst sink into abyssal pressure, severely slowing them
		"It remembers the sound the deep makes when it breaks things"
		'''
}

TideReaper: {
	DisplayName: Tide Reaper
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Hurls a spinning abyssal scythe that boomerangs back to you
		In flight it flings tide crescents that hunt nearby enemies
		Right click to throw a vortex anchor: the scythe pins ahead and spins into a maelstrom
		The maelstrom drags enemies inward and flings crescents faster before returning
		"When the tide goes out, only bones are left on the shore"
		'''
}

BudPiercer: {
	DisplayName: Budpiercer
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Flies straight for a moment, then dips
		Striking an enemy plants a bud that soon blooms into a ring of petals
		Multiple daggers can stack buds on the same target
		Sticking into the ground blooms on the spot, spraying three needles upward
		"Under the serpent's scales, every one of them wants to bloom"
		'''
}

Budcrown: {
	DisplayName: Budcrown
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Hold the attack key to whirl the head around you, release to hurl it at your cursor
		The head sheds needles when it strikes enemies
		Every third strike bursts into full bloom, blasting a ring of petals with heavy knockback
		"The heaviest bud blooms the loudest"
		'''
}
